{"id": "doc-01", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Une équipe peut aligner au maximum **onze joueurs** sur le terrain [ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1] ; le même plafond de onze joueurs est confirmé dans l’introduction de la loi 3 du football [wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-8-du-football#balle-a-terre/2", "ifab-loi-03#7-personne-supplementaire-sur-le-terrain/1", "ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/5"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 976, "tokens_out": 189, "latency_s": 8.482836824999993, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-02", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un match ne peut pas commencer ou continuer si une équipe compte moins de **sept joueurs** [wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/2] [ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1].", "sources": ["wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/2", "ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/2", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#introduction/2", "ifab-loi-03#1-nombre-de-joueurs/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/11", "wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 747, "tokens_out": 237, "latency_s": 0.8628812499999867, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-03", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Une équipe peut effectuer **cinq remplacements** au maximum dans le temps réglementaire d’un match de compétition officielle, et **un sixième remplacement** est possible lorsqu’une prolongation est jouée【ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/1】【wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2】.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/1", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#competitions-officielles/1", "ifab-loi-03#2-nombre-de-remplacements/4", "wiki-loi-3-du-football#competitions-officielles/2", "wiki-remplacant-football#introduction/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 939, "tokens_out": 414, "latency_s": 8.536175102000016, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-04", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "La circonférence du ballon doit être comprise entre 68 cm et 70 cm [ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1] [wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2] [wiki-ballon-de-football#caracteristiques/1].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#caracteristiques/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#caracteristiques/1", "wiki-ballon-de-football#introduction/1", "wiki-ballon-de-football#historique/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1123, "tokens_out": 234, "latency_s": 12.375812339999982, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-05", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Le ballon doit peser entre 410 g et 450 g au début du match [ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1] [wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-02#1-specifications/1", "wiki-loi-2-du-football#reglement-actuel/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#introduction/2", "wiki-ballon-de-football#caracteristiques/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1112, "tokens_out": 340, "latency_s": 9.156162359999996, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-06", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les lignes de touche doivent mesurer **au minimum 90 m** et **au maximum 120 m** [ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-01#3-dimensions", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#dimensions", "ifab-loi-01#4-dimensions-pour-les-matches-internationaux", "ifab-loi-01#2-marquage-du-terrain/2", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#marquage-du-terrain/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 969, "tokens_out": 193, "latency_s": 9.848472130000005, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-07", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les lignes de la surface de réparation sont tracées à 16,5 m (18 yds) des poteaux du but【ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/1】【wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1】.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/1", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/1", "ifab-loi-01#6-surface-de-reparation/2", "wiki-loi-1-du-football#surface-de-reparation/2", "ifab-loi-01#5-surface-de-but"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 841, "tokens_out": 192, "latency_s": 6.879988459000003, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-08", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Chaque période d’un match dure 45 minutes. [ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#periodes-de-jeu", "ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#arret-definitif-du-match/2", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#introduction"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 727, "tokens_out": 98, "latency_s": 8.855016487, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-09", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "La pause entre les deux périodes ne peut pas dépasser **15 minutes**【ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps】.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-07#2-mi-temps", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#mi-temps", "ifab-loi-07#1-periodes-de-jeu", "wiki-loi-7-du-football#periodes-de-jeu", "ifab-loi-07#3-recuperation-des-arrets-de-jeu/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 816, "tokens_out": 134, "latency_s": 6.71508263000004, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-10", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Un corner est accordé à l’équipe adverse : le gardien a conservé le ballon à la main plus de huit secondes dans sa surface de réparation, ce qui entraîne la remise du ballon en corner à l’endroit le plus proche où le gardien l’avait détenu [ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1]. Le corner sera exécuté depuis la surface de coin correspondante, le ballon devant être immobile avant d’être botté [wiki-corner-football#procedure].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1", "wiki-corner-football#procedure"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-12#3-corner/1", "ifab-loi-12#3-corner/2", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#corner/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#main/3", "wiki-corner-football#procedure"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 900, "tokens_out": 245, "latency_s": 8.30077240700001, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-11", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les adversaires doivent se placer à **au moins 9,15 m** du ballon jusqu’à ce qu’il soit en jeu. [ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4]", "sources": ["ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-12#2-coup-franc-indirect/6", "ifab-loi-13#2-procedure/4", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#coup-franc-direct/4", "wiki-loi-13-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/6"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 925, "tokens_out": 115, "latency_s": 6.84524399999998, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-12", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Si le ballon pénètre directement dans le but adverse lors d’une rentrée de touche, aucun but n’est validé ; il faut accorder un coup de pied de but : « si le ballon pénètre dans le but adverse, un coup de pied de but doit être accordé »【ifab-loi-15#introduction】. Cette règle est confirmée par la description de l’exécution : « Si le ballon pénètre dans le but adverse, il est accordé un coup de pied de but »【wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3】.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-15#1-procedure/2", "ifab-loi-15#introduction", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#execution/3", "wiki-loi-15-du-football#conditions", "ifab-loi-15#1-procedure/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 910, "tokens_out": 235, "latency_s": 9.252719043000013, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-13", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Non, un joueur ne peut pas être sanctionné pour hors‑jeu s’il reçoit le ballon directement sur une rentrée de touche, car aucune infraction de hors‑jeu n’est retenue dans ce cas [ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction] [wiki-loi-11-du-football#exceptions].", "sources": ["ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#exceptions"], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-11-du-football#infraction-de-hors-jeu/8", "ifab-loi-11#3-pas-d-infraction", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#exceptions", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/1", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/8"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 898, "tokens_out": 204, "latency_s": 7.280643971999893, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.5, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-14", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les parties du corps prises en compte sont la tête, le tronc et les jambes ; les mains et les bras ne sont pas considérés dans le calcul de la position de hors‑jeu【ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1】.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/1", "wiki-loi-11-du-football#position-de-hors-jeu", "ifab-loi-11#1-position-de-hors-jeu/2", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/3", "ifab-loi-11#2-infraction-de-hors-jeu/1"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1027, "tokens_out": 207, "latency_s": 10.018165185000043, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-15", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Si un joueur retarde indûment l’exécution d’un coup de pied de but, l’arbitre siffle, indique le début d’un décompte de cinq secondes (visuel, main levée). Si le coup n’est pas tiré au terme de ce délai, un corner est accordé à l’équipe adverse ; le joueur ne sera averti que s’il persiste à retarder excessivement la reprise du jeu après l’attribution du corner【ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1】.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/1", "ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/4", "ifab-loi-16#2-infractions-et-sanctions/3", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#infractions-et-sanctions/3", "wiki-loi-16-du-football#coup-de-pied-de-but"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1022, "tokens_out": 252, "latency_s": 8.267083065000065, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": false, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-16", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Le gardien doit rester sur la ligne de but, face au tireur et entre les poteaux, avec au moins un pied sur ou derrière la ligne (ou au même niveau si le pied ne touche pas le sol) au moment du tir. [wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1] ; [ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3]", "sources": ["wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3"], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/3", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/1", "wiki-penalty-football#procedure/3", "ifab-loi-14#1-procedure/2", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#main/3"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 969, "tokens_out": 255, "latency_s": 10.539682146000018, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-17", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Chaque équipe commence par exécuter cinq tirs au but. [wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1] [ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/8]", "sources": ["wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/8"], "retrieved": ["wiki-tirs-au-but#introduction/1", "wiki-loi-10-du-football#nombre-de-tirs-au-but/1", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/8", "ifab-loi-10#3-tirs-au-but/9", "wiki-tirs-au-but#handball"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 1027, "tokens_out": 170, "latency_s": 9.028316873999984, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 0.3333333333333333, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-18", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Les décisions pouvant être soumises à l’assistance vidéo à l’arbitrage se répartissent en deux grands groupes :\n\n* **Décisions factuelles** : localisation d’une infraction ou d’un hors‑jeu, point de contact (main/faute), emplacement de la faute (dans ou hors de la surface), situation où le ballon est hors du jeu, etc. [ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12]\n\n* **Décisions subjectives** : appréciation de l’intensité d’une faute, interférence lors d’un hors‑jeu, jugements relatifs aux fautes de main, etc. [ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/11]\n\nCes analyses interviennent uniquement dans les cinq catégories d’incidents ou de décisions prévues par le protocole VAR. [ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1]", "sources": ["ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/11", "ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1"], "retrieved": ["ifab-protocole-var#2-incidents-decisions-pouvant-faire-l-objet-d-une-analyse/1", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/12", "ifab-protocole-var#1-principes/3", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/11", "ifab-protocole-var#4-procedures/16"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 991, "tokens_out": 534, "latency_s": 9.672071453999934, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": false, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-19", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "Ken Aston, l'arbitre anglais, a eu l'idée d'utiliser des cartes de couleur pour les avertissements et les exclusions [wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1].", "sources": ["wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1"], "retrieved": ["wiki-carton-jaune#creation/1", "wiki-carton-jaune#football/1", "wiki-arbitre-football#tenue-de-l-arbitre/2", "wiki-carton-rouge#cricket", "wiki-carton-jaune#creation/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 872, "tokens_out": 138, "latency_s": 8.77634252300004, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "doc-20", "type": "doc", "level": 1, "answer": "L’IFAB a intégré l’assistance vidéo à l’arbitrage dans les lois du jeu en 2018 [wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/2].", "sources": ["wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/2"], "retrieved": ["wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/1", "wiki-arbitre-football#utilisation-officielle/1", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#introduction/1", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#championnats-nationaux", "wiki-assistance-video-a-l-arbitrage-en-football#historique/2"], "abstained": false, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 969, "tokens_out": 194, "latency_s": 8.11290717999998, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "recall@5": 1.0, "mrr": 1.0, "correct": true, "cited": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "absent-01", "type": "absent", "level": 1, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Les extraits fournis ne précisent pas le salaire de l'arbitre d'une finale de Coupe du monde.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["wiki-loi-6-du-football#introduction", "wiki-arbitre-football#introduction/1", "ifab-loi-05#2-decisions-de-l-arbitre/2", "wiki-arbitre-football#un-role-de-juge-contraint-qui-assure-l-integrite-de-l-homme/8", "wiki-loi-4-du-football#infractions-sanctions/5"], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 983, "tokens_out": 172, "latency_s": 9.003195076999987, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "correct": true, "trial": 0}
{"id": "absent-02", "type": "absent", "level": 1, "answer": "[ABSTENTION] Aucun des extraits fournis ne précise le montant d’une amende infligée à un club lorsque son entraîneur est exclu.", "sources": [], "retrieved": ["ifab-loi-03#7-personne-supplementaire-sur-le-terrain/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#suspensions/1", "wiki-loi-12-du-football#introduction/1", "ifab-loi-12#4-mesures-disciplinaires/17", "ifab-loi-04#6-infractions-et-sanctions/2"], "abstained": true, "clarified": false, "refused": false, "tool_calls": [], "pending_action": null, "tokens_in": 977, "tokens_out": 99, "latency_s": 8.805635230999997, "steps": 1, "stop_reason": "final", "error": null, "correct": true, "trial": 0}
